developing the right content

00:03:39.871 --> 00:03:40.620
for your audience.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.990
With Google Slides
templates, you

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:49.280
can also create
presentations that scale.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.430
We talked about
starting off a template

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:54.410
